ATTRIBUTION NOTICE

The v2.0 deep learning implementation builds upon CliffDelineaTool v1.0 by:

  Swirad, Z.M. and Young, A.P., 2022. CliffDelineaTool v1.2.0: an algorithm for
  identifying coastal cliff base and top positions. Geoscientific Model
  Development, 15(4), pp.1499-1512. https://doi.org/10.5194/gmd-15-1499-2022

The original v1.0 code (in /v1) and training datasets (in /datasets) are from
Swirad & Young (2022), available at: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5724975
